[Unit]
Description=UFO client registering the gx10 as Galaxy device dgx_gx10
PartOf=ufo-galaxy.target
# The older ~/UFO install (ufo-server/ufo-mcp/ufo-client) uses the same ports.
Conflicts=ufo-server.service ufo-mcp.service ufo-client.service
Requires=ufo-galaxy-server.service
After=ufo-galaxy-server.service ufo-linux-mcp.service

[Service]
Type=simple
WorkingDirectory=%h/ufo-galaxy
# UFO_WS_TOKEN is appended to the URL by the client, so it never appears in argv.
EnvironmentFile=%h/ufo-galaxy/.secrets
Environment=UFO_DGX_HOST=127.0.0.1 PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
UMask=0077
ExecStartPre=/bin/sh -c 'for i in $$(seq 1 60); do ss -ltn | grep -q "127.0.0.1:5001 " && exit 0; sleep 1; done; echo "server not listening on 5001"; exit 1'
ExecStart=%h/ufo-galaxy/.venv/bin/python -m ufo.client.client --ws --ws-server ws://127.0.0.1:5001/ws --client-id dgx_gx10 --platform linux --max-retries 20
Restart=always
RestartSec=10
StandardOutput=append:%h/ufo-galaxy/logs/client.log
StandardError=inherit

[Install]
WantedBy=ufo-galaxy.target
